{"id":"dbe39bed658f1512","group":"58","path":"58/batch20/58-df-zfc-recursion2-kleene-o.md","title":"ZFC Recursion2 Kleene O","display":"df-zfc-recursion2-kleene-o — ZFC Recursion2 Kleene O","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-recursion2-kleene-o","aliases":["58-df-zfc-recursion2-kleene-o"],"display":"df-zfc-recursion2-kleene-o — ZFC Recursion2 Kleene O","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[58-df-function]]","[[58-df-order-type]]","[[58-df-zfc-comp-computable-relation]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-recursion2-kleene-o"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-recursion2-kleene-o</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-recursion2-kleene-o — ZFC Recursion2 Kleene O"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"58-df-function\">58-df-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"5d2cd56a38a81b7a\" href=\"?note=5d2cd56a38a81b7a\" title=\"58-df-order-type\">58-df-order-type</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"d46cc386592a0ac3\" href=\"?note=d46cc386592a0ac3\" title=\"58-df-zfc-comp-computable-relation\">58-df-zfc-comp-computable-relation</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal O\\subseteq\\omega\">\\(\\mathcal O\\subseteq\\omega\\)</span> (Kleene-notation candidate)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"W\\in V\">\\(W\\in V\\)</span> (acceptable enumeration graph of computable binary relations on <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\">\\(\\omega\\)</span>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\\subseteq\\omega\\times\\omega\">\\(R\\subseteq\\omega\\times\\omega\\)</span> (computable-relation candidate in the coverage clause)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function},\\mathrm{OrderType}_S,\\mathrm{ZfcCompComputableRelation}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Function},\\mathrm{OrderType}_S,\\mathrm{ZfcCompComputableRelation}_S\\)</span> (sourced predicates)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion2KleeneO}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion2KleeneO}_S\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}recursion2\\text{-}kleene\\text{-}o} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcRecursion2KleeneO}_S(\\mathcal O,W)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Function}(W,\\omega,\\mathcal P(\\omega\\times\\omega))\\land\\forall e\\in\\omega\\;\\mathrm{ZfcCompComputableRelation}_S(W(e))\\land\\forall R\\subseteq\\omega\\times\\omega\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{ZfcCompComputableRelation}_S(R)\\to\\exists e\\in\\omega\\;(W(e)=R)\\bigr)\\land\\mathcal O=\\{e\\in\\omega:\\exists\\alpha\\in V\\;\\mathrm{OrderType}_S(\\alpha,\\omega,W(e))\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}recursion2\\text{-}kleene\\text{-}o} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcRecursion2KleeneO}_S(\\mathcal O,W)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Function}(W,\\omega,\\mathcal P(\\omega\\times\\omega))\\land\\forall e\\in\\omega\\;\\mathrm{ZfcCompComputableRelation}_S(W(e))\\land\\forall R\\subseteq\\omega\\times\\omega\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{ZfcCompComputableRelation}_S(R)\\to\\exists e\\in\\omega\\;(W(e)=R)\\bigr)\\land\\mathcal O=\\{e\\in\\omega:\\exists\\alpha\\in V\\;\\mathrm{OrderType}_S(\\alpha,\\omega,W(e))\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The graph <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"W\">\\(W\\)</span> is required to cover every computable binary relation, rather than merely listing computable relations.  Relative to this explicit numbering, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal O\">\\(\\mathcal O\\)</span> consists exactly of indices whose relations well-order <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\">\\(\\omega\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-function","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-order-type","status":"resolved","id":"5d2cd56a38a81b7a","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-order-type]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-comp-computable-relation","status":"resolved","id":"d46cc386592a0ac3","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-comp-computable-relation]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal O\\subseteq\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"W\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"R\\subseteq\\omega\\times\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Function},\\mathrm{OrderType}_S,\\mathrm{ZfcCompComputableRelation}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion2KleeneO}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}recursion2\\text{-}kleene\\text{-}o} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcRecursion2KleeneO}_S(\\mathcal O,W)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Function}(W,\\omega,\\mathcal P(\\omega\\times\\omega))\\land\\forall e\\in\\omega\\;\\mathrm{ZfcCompComputableRelation}_S(W(e))\\land\\forall R\\subseteq\\omega\\times\\omega\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{ZfcCompComputableRelation}_S(R)\\to\\exists e\\in\\omega\\;(W(e)=R)\\bigr)\\land\\mathcal O=\\{e\\in\\omega:\\exists\\alpha\\in V\\;\\mathrm{OrderType}_S(\\alpha,\\omega,W(e))\\}","display":true},{"tex":"W","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal O","display":false},{"tex":"\\omega","display":false}],"bytes":1542,"backlinks":[{"id":"a11585cba9c21cfd","anchor":"ref-338","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-recursion2-kleene-o]]"},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-3233","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch20/58-df-zfc-recursion2-kleene-o.md|58-df-zfc-recursion2-kleene-o]]（batch20）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","36d7463d215be751","5d2cd56a38a81b7a","d46cc386592a0ac3"]}